<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY UNION-QUEENSLAND BEAT GAUTENG LIONS 40-27.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-QUEENSLAND BEAT GAUTENG LIONS 40-27.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE, Australia 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Queensland beat</p>
<p>Gauteng Lions 40-27 (halftime 25-10) in a Super 12 rugby union</p>
<p>match at Ballymore on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Queensland - Tries: Scott Webster, Jason Little, Damian</p>
<p>Smith, Tim Horan, Daniel Herbert. Conversions: John Eales (3).</p>
<p>Penalties: John Eales (3).</p>
<p>Gauteng Lions - Tries: Chris Rossouw (2), Warren Brosnihan,</p>
<p>Jopie Adlam. Conversions: Dawie Du Toit, Edrich Lubbe. Penalty:</p>
<p>Edrich Lubbe.</p>
</text>
